\q2 and a great king over all gods: 
\q1
\v 4 For the ends of the earth are in his hands; 
\q2 and the heights of the mountains are his. 
\q1
\v 5 For the sea is his, and he made it: 
\q2 and his hands formed the dry land. 
\q1
\v 6 Come, let us worship and fall down before him; 
\q2 and weep before the Lord who made us. 
\q1
