\q2 and we are the people of his pasture, 
\q2 and the sheep of his hand. 
\q1
\v 8 \x + \xo 94:8 \xt Heb. 3. 7-12.\x*Today, if you hear his voice, don't harden your hearts, as in the rebellion, 
\q2 as in the day of testing in the wilderness: 
\q1
\v 9 where your fathers tempted me, 
\q2 proved me, and saw my works. 
\q1
