\q2 and said, They always go astray in their hearts, 
\q2 and they have not known my ways. 
\q1
\v 11 So I swore in my wrath, 
\q2 They will not enter into my rest. 
\c 95 
\d
\v 1 When the house was built after the Captivity. A Song of David. 
\q1
\v 1b Sing to the Lord a new song;
\q2 sing to the Lord, all the earth. 
\q1
\v 2 Sing to the Lord, bless his name: 
\q2 proclaim his salvation from day to day. 
\q1
