\q2 and don't forget all his benefits: 
\q1
\v 3 who forgives all your transgressions, 
\q2 who heals all your diseases; 
\q1
\v 4 who redeems your life from corruption; 
\q2 who crowns you with mercy and compassion; 
\q1
\v 5 who satisfies your desire with good things: 
\q2 your youth will be renewed like that of the eagle. 
\q1
