\q1
\v 25 \add So is\add* this great and wide sea: 
\q2 innumerable things are creeping there, small animals and great. 
\q1
\v 26 There go the ships; 
\q2 \add and\add* this \f + \fr 103:26 \fqa Gr. \ft δράκων, traditionally 'dragon'; here, mighty sea creature.\f*mighty serpent whom you have made to play in it. 
\q1
\v 27 All wait upon you, 
\q2 to give them \add their\add* food in due season. 
